### Requiere: Seed__Demo=true. Ejecutar en este orden (extensión REST Client de VS Code).
@base = http://localhost:5080

### 0. Salud del servicio
GET {{base}}/health

### 1. Asignación exitosa -> 200
POST {{base}}/api/deliveries/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/assignment
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-001

{ "courierId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "routeId": "cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc" }

### 2. Consultar la entrega -> Assigned
GET {{base}}/api/deliveries/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 3. Asignación duplicada -> 409 DELIVERY_ALREADY_ASSIGNED
POST {{base}}/api/deliveries/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/assignment
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "routeId": "cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc" }

### 4. Entrega inexistente -> 404 DELIVERY_NOT_FOUND
POST {{base}}/api/deliveries/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999/assignment
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "routeId": "cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc" }

### 5. Repartidor fuera de turno -> 422 COURIER_NOT_AVAILABLE
POST {{base}}/api/deliveries/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/assignment
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb", "routeId": "cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc" }

### 6. Ruta saturada -> 409 ROUTE_SATURATED
POST {{base}}/api/deliveries/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333/assignment
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "routeId": "dddddddd-dddd-dddd-dddd-dddddddddddd" }

### 7. Entrega cancelada -> 409 DELIVERY_NOT_ASSIGNABLE
POST {{base}}/api/deliveries/44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444/assignment
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "routeId": "cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc" }
